#CHLOEAI:1
PROJECT_CARTRIDGE="true"

USAGE:
Active state only. Historical DECISIONS, DELTA, and old HANDOFFs live in
ai_context/readme_AI_archive.chloeai (Tier 2 — read on demand).

AI PROCEDURE:
1) Read this file fully before analysis or execution.
2) Do not infer project state without it.
3) Begin interaction by:
   - Echoing the Unlock Phrase
   - Listing THREADS (id, status, tier)
   - Listing ASSUMPTIONS (or "none")
   - Surfacing most recent HANDOFF: zoom_level, recommended_model, recommended_effort, task_queue
   - If recommended model/effort differs from current: flag it and wait for user to adjust
4) If required context is missing or unclear, STOP and request clarification.

SCOPE:
- This file tracks active state: open THREADS, latest 1-2 HANDOFFs.
- AI behavior and rules live in ai_modules/hi_mode.chloeai and ai_context/ai_rules.chloeai.
- History lives in ai_context/readme_AI_archive.chloeai.

---

UNLOCK_PHRASE:
"{{UNLOCK_PHRASE}}"

---

STATE:
PROJECT_NAME="{{PROJECT_NAME}}"
REPO="{{REPO_PATH_OR_URL}}"
GOAL="{{PROJECT_GOAL_STATEMENT}}"
STATUS="Bootstrapped {{TODAY}} — awaiting first real work"

CURRENT_BRANCH="main"

THREADS:
- THR-001|open|tier=sonnet|"Define project goal, scope, and success criteria"
- THR-002|open|tier=sonnet|"Define initial work threads and acceptance criteria"

ASSUMPTIONS:
- none

---

HANDOFF_LOG:
; Keep latest 1-2 entries here. Move older entries to ai_context/readme_AI_archive.chloeai.
; Format:
; @date|SESSION|
; zoom_level=STRATEGIC|TACTICAL|OPERATIONAL
; recommended_model=haiku|sonnet|opus
; recommended_effort=low|medium|high
; reason="..."
; task_queue=[{tier:X, task:"..."},...]
; next_zoom_trigger="..."
; signed="Model | version | date"

@2026-04-29|SESSION-001|
zoom_level=STRATEGIC
recommended_model=sonnet
recommended_effort=medium
reason="New project with placeholder state. First work is to define PROJECT_NAME, REPO, GOAL, STATUS, and initial THREADS before any implementation."
task_queue=[
  {tier:sonnet, task:"Define project goal, scope, and success criteria"},
  {tier:sonnet, task:"Define initial work threads and acceptance criteria"},
  {tier:haiku, task:"Set up remote repository (if external)"}
]
next_zoom_trigger="Initial project definition complete (PROJECT_NAME, GOAL, initial THREADS defined) → zoom to TACTICAL"
signed="Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 | Charter-HI-Mode-Repo-2026-04b | 2026-04-29"
